OL,3,ACopper wire upgrade work caused
OL,4,Anationwide flight suspension, US
OL,5,Atransport secretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA nationwide US ground stop that caused
OL,8,Fthousands of flight cancellations was
OL,9,Fcaused by an issue following a copper
OL,10,Fwire upgrade, Transport Secretary Sean
OL,11,FDuffy says
OL,13,FThe router that was being worked on
OL,14,Fstarted flooding other air traffic
OL,15,Fcontrol systems, he says, which created
OL,16,Fcommunication issues with planes
OL,18,FMore than 3,500 flights have been
OL,19,Fcancelled and more than 2,000 delayed
OL,20,Fin the US on Saturday alone, according
OL,21,Fto tracking website Flight Aware, as
OL,22,Fknock-on disruption continues
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
