OL,3,ACopper wire upgrade work caused
OL,4,Anationwide flight suspension, US
OL,5,Atransport secretary says
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe grounding began at around 16:00 EST
OL,8,F(21:00 GMT) on Friday and lasted more
OL,9,Fthan four hours - here's a timeline of
OL,10,Fhow it unfolded
OL,12,FDuffy previously said the ripple
OL,13,Feffects could last for days - it was
OL,14,Fthe longest ground stop in the US since
OL,15,Fthe one after the 9/11 attacks in 2001
